{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e5cf1de2-7eff-8ead-a19f-07de5ffd6021",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T12:32:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Deirdre Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:30:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Lorraine. Well, I'm either calling the right place or I'm about to be transferred four times, so we'll see. I've got a streetlight that's gone dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can take that. Do you know where the light is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:30:57-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right out front of 291 Coggeshall Avenue. Up on the Hill. I'm standing at the window of my shop, actually, waiting on a delivery driver to bring supplies to my job site, so I've got nothing better to do than stare at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:31:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 291 Coggeshall Avenue. And what's it doing, is it out completely or flickering?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Completely dark. And I think I know why. There's a big limb hanging down right over the lamp, covering it up. Nothing's fallen, mind you. The tree's fine, it's just the branch is sitting on top of the light like a hat. A bad hat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So a tree limb is covering the streetlight and the light is dark, but nothing has come down. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Whether the bulb's gone too, I couldn't tell you. I'm seventy-something, not a lineman."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:31:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I'll put it in so the crew can look at both the limb and the light. Is this one in front of the building, on the street side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:31:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Street side, yes. On the pole by the curb, just in front of my door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:32:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And can I get a callback number in case we need to reach you about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:32:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:32:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, zero one six two. Name on the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:32:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deirdre Sullivan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Sullivan. I've got the request in for 291 Coggeshall Avenue. Expect someone out there within the next week or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:32:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Thank you, Lorraine. Oh, there's my driver now. Bye."
    }
  ],
